# README media: FORLORN HOPE. Everything in play is the demo player's real
# button presses on its route through the map. The GIF is the first two
# volunteers: the blind drop into the spike pit (the first goes down
# holding B and leaves a stone there), and the next, who lands on that
# stone, takes key 1 from its shelf and stones plate 1.
shotscale 2
seed 32
game forlorn
wait 60
shot forlorn_title
cheat start 1
wait 30
shot forlorn_door
gifstart forlorn 3 1
botuntil lost >= 2 2000
botplay 40
gifstop
# the runner up the Old Yew
botuntil units >= 3 400
botuntil y <= 120 900
botplay 20
shot forlorn_yew
# the mason climbing the tower after its duel with the stingback
botuntil units >= 9 20000
botuntil y >= 700 4000
botuntil y <= 380 6000
shot forlorn_tower
# a sapper dropping on the upper left heart
botuntil units >= 14 20000
botuntil y >= 300 2000
botuntil y >= 388 400
botplay 6
shot forlorn_hearts
# the ending: the roll is read
botuntil state == 5 30000
wait 700
shot forlorn_ending
